F PresentScalarEntry                    | Api/ControlPanel.h              | 237       | An unbounded scalar: the same value box, and a centre-knobbed track that accumulates travel rather than mapping position, so the reading may leave any span. readout — a knob that travelled would imply a span this control does not have.
